      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Favored Enemy (construct) class feature</p><p>The blue mage's weapon attacks ignore a number of points of damage reduction or hardness equal to half her favored enemy (construct) bonus. This talent allows her to only ignore damage reduction that is normally bypassed by adamantine, bludgeoning, piercing, and slashing weapons. Against constructs, the amount of damage reduction and hardness she ignores is equal to her full favored enemy bonus.</p>",
